families to known results. The narrative stays unchanged.\n\n**Search topics:**\n- Cooper–Frieze, cover time of random regular graphs\n- Cooper–Frieze, cover time of sparse random graphs (Erdős–Rényi)\n- Dembo–Peres–Rosen–Zeitouni, cover times for random walks in two dimensions (torus)\n\n## Deliberately not targeted\n\n- **Quantitative results** (Tables 2–3, per-family numbers, controls). These are grounded in evaluator output.\npostdraft_citation_weave_agent_claude_20261027_182218.log\npostdraft_citation_weave_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_agent_claude_20261027_182218.log\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\npostdraft_reference_retrieval.log\npostdraft_references.bib\npostdraft_references_provenance.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
